          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறியீடு — kuṟiyīṭu — \"a code; a symbol\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்தக் கதவைத் திறக்க ஒரு ரகசியக் குறியீடு வேண்டும். intak katavait tiṟakka oru rakaciyak kuṟiyīṭu vēṇṭum. To open this door you need a secret code."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறி \"a mark\" with the noun ending -īṭu: a mark that stands for something."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறியீடு (kuṟiyīṭu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1847 gives குறி (kuṟi), \"a mark, a sign, a symbol\"; the ending -īṭu makes a noun of the act of marking."
            }
          ]
        },
