          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காப்புப்பிரதி (kāppuppirati) is a modern compound: the native காப்பு (kāppu), \"protection\", from கா (kā), \"to guard\" (DEDR 1416), and பிரதி (pirati), \"a copy\", from Sanskrit prati, \"against, in return\" (Monier-Williams)."
