          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "செயற்கை (ceyaṟkai) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1957 lists செயற்கை (ceyaṟkai), \"action\", under செய் (cey), \"to do, to make\". Today it means \"man-made\", the pair of இயற்கை, nature."
